---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /next/
title: "What is coming next — RegSymp"
description: "The 33: thirty-three people, one table, in places worth travelling to. London, Davos, Lapland, Napa Valley, Barcelona and Mallorca."
---
{#
  Coming next.

  The homepage carries a summary; this is the same events with room to breathe.
  Both are built from the events table, so announcing one is adding a row.
#}
<main id="main-content">

<section class="section dark-deep next-hero" aria-labelledby="next-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">{{ upcomingCopy.eyebrow }}</span>
    <h1 class="h-display" id="next-heading">{{ upcomingCopy.heading }}</h1>
    {% if upcomingCopy.footnote %}
    <p class="next-lede">{{ upcomingCopy.footnote }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section light next-list-section">
  <div class="container">
    {% if events and events.upcoming and events.upcoming.length %}
    <ol class="next-list">
      {% for event in events.upcoming %}
      <li class="next-item reveal">
        <div class="next-when">
          <span class="next-date">{{ event.whenLabel }}</span>
          {% if event.series %}<span class="next-series">{{ event.series }}</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="next-what">
          <h2 class="next-place">{{ event.city or event.name }}{% if event.country %}<span class="next-country">, {{ event.country }}</span>{% endif %}</h2>
          {% if event.tagline %}<p class="next-tagline">{{ event.tagline }}</p>{% endif %}
          {% if event.summary %}<p class="next-summary">{{ event.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
    {% else %}
    {# Nothing announced yet. Saying so is better than an empty page that looks
       like a fault. #}
    <p class="next-none">Nothing is announced just yet. The next dates will appear here first.</p>
    {% endif %}

    <p class="next-back">
      <a class="hero-link" href="/">The current edition <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

</main>
